          "en": "Buying tip\n\nBig Myeongdong/Hongdae/Gangnam stores have deeper stock than airport shops. Ask staff about app coupons and gift-with-purchase.",
          "ja": "買い方\n\n明洞・弘大・江南の大型店が在庫豊富。空港店は欠品しがち。アプリクーポンも聞いてみて。"
