      "desc": "For life-threatening emergencies call 112 (police) or 119 (fire/ambulance). Use 1330 for tourist help, 1345 for immigration (weekdays), 1339 for non-emergency medical guidance, and 1588-5644 (BBB) for volunteer phone interpretation.",
