      "spaTip": "Buying tip\n\nCompare Myeongdong/Hongdae/Gangnam shops; watch for sale seasons.",
      "socksBody1": "Value socks/tights: Shoopen, SPAO, Uniqlo, Daiso 3–5 packs. Hanbok-style and character socks make easy gifts.",
